  "body_text": "我们要（又要嘎嘎嘎）换包装咯～\n‍\n‍\n新包装将统一100g/200g为一个袋子\n- 方便生产系统追溯、食品安全管理等食品生产管理诉求\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n镭射材质\n- blingbling，但素是哑光的，还是比较不怎么张扬的，这回尝试了\n触感膜\n，摸起来手感还阔以呢～\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n顶部做了一个\n信封的小设计，\n配豆卡\n！！！终于豆卡安排上了！！！，可以拿下来折叠起来做收集，可以整整齐齐的把它们收起来放一个小盒子里，也可以写一些手帐塞里面闹\nOh YEAH！完事！\n‍\n‍\n‍",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content autoTypeSetting24psection\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           我们要（又要嘎嘎嘎）换包装咯～\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RKjM7GEvAtO6bQichia2I8LjZyX1l33RpXDuYAZ4W2IUMuu3wuCx7OKWicedhlaGtxwSs2GpLQbN8jw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RKjM7GEvAtO6bQichia2I8LjwYO8iaebq8EpBd8bpVcibsAebY7FIojZoZUpMjqLiatqI9RpHao7p68Og/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"text-align: center;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);letter-spacing: 0.034em;\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-size: 14px;\">\n           新包装将统一100g/200g为一个袋子\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-size: 14px;\">\n          - 方便生产系统追溯、食品安全管理等食品生产管理诉求\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           镭射材质\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          - blingbling，但素是哑光的，还是比较不怎么张扬的，这回尝试了\n          <strong>\n           触感膜\n          </strong>\n          ，摸起来手感还阔以呢～\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          顶部做了一个\n          <strong>\n           信封的小设计，\n          </strong>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;text-decoration: none;\">\n<strong>\n           配豆卡\n          </strong>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          ！！！终于豆卡安排上了！！！，可以拿下来折叠起来做收集，可以整整齐齐的把它们收起来放一个小盒子里，也可以写一些手帐塞里面闹\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RKjM7GEvAtO6bQichia2I8LjKwv7vV2cpMxyjZl7JAy8gnZTPOMbsgiaCTz80UicDflW8UiaNyib6Ru0mw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RKjM7GEvAtO6bQichia2I8LjrnaGUS7cnyPicLU0cb8nufqEtEyMNwo6M1tTVEgwp5Kt9e1MtDnZcqg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RKjM7GEvAtO6bQichia2I8LjLW26kQTeSeTxSCUfhqMrWibFqXYgXu6Lttn2ka16IFTicJh21HicLUib3A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Oh YEAH！完事！\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
